{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":151007,"duration_api_ms":149649,"num_turns":15,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6f63f127-7874-485f-8af7-f197ceb40aad","total_cost_usd":0.6741539500000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":14,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34204,"cache_read_input_tokens":471708,"output_tokens":3575,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20963,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13241},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":14,"outputTokens":3575,"cacheReadInputTokens":471708,"cacheCreationInputTokens":34204,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5390739999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":108,"outputTokens":5503,"cacheReadInputTokens":587107,"cacheCreationInputTokens":38997,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.13507995,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"summary":"Verified all six amendments against the codebase. Accept the test double-execution fix and the root oxygenation bonus metric fix. Reject the biofilter (None,None) amendment because its factual premise is wrong — the arm actually calls record_check, not a silent no-op. Reject the registry caching suggestion as speculative optimization. Reject the doc comment amendment because the clarification already exists. Reject the build-break claim because cargo check succeeds and the fields exist.","votes":[{"amendment_id":"fr-5-9708b232","decision":"accept","rationale":"Verified: both the individual #[test] functions and the summary #[test] call the same `run_probe_*_with_suffix` body — the suffix only changes artifact naming, not the simulation itself. Each expensive multi-day simulation runs twice for zero additional assertion coverage. Gating the individual tests with #[ignore] or deduplicating is a sound CI efficiency improvement."},{"amendment_id":"fr-5-2e04c8d7","decision":"reject","rationale":"The amendment's factual premise is wrong. The (None, None) arm at line 510 is NOT a silent no-op — it calls `record_check(&mut runs, \"biofilter_no_clearance_fallback\", ...)` which checks that the larger filter still finishes with lower TAN and no worse NO₂. The outcome is fully visible in the probe summary. There is no silent pass."},{"amendment_id":"fr-5-a69caaa7","decision":"reject","rationale":"This is a speculative micro-optimization with no demonstrated performance problem. The function intentionally computes a fresh habitat registry from current state each tick. Passing a cached registry would introduce freshness assumptions and coupling between step phases. Without profiling evidence showing this is a bottleneck, the change adds complexity for hypothetical benefit."},{"amendment_id":"fr-5-a672a7f8","decision":"reject","rationale":"The requested doc comment already exists at lines 96-100 of substrate.rs types: 'Dynamic O₂ penetration boundary depth (cm below the substrate surface) ... The same shared stack boundary is serialized onto each layer so save/load can round-trip the zone state without a separate top-level substrate-zone payload.' This exactly addresses the ambiguity the amendment raises."},{"amendment_id":"fr-5-6409353a","decision":"reject","rationale":"The build-break claim does not reproduce. `cargo check -q` succeeds with no output. All sixteen fields cited (density_repro_threshold_per_l, egg_drop_temp_swing_c, instability_*, etc.) exist on ShrimpPreset in presets.rs (lines 591-621) and are correctly read in tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs (lines 895-941). The workspace builds cleanly."},{"amendment_id":"fr-5-f084dd66","decision":"accept","rationale":"Verified: root_oxygenation_bonus_cm is computed via exponential saturation against total_depth_cm (line 106), then effective_penetration_cm = (base + bonus).clamp(0, total_depth) (line 112-113). When base_penetration_cm is already at or near total_depth_cm (e.g., the low-demand path at line 182-183 returns substrate_depth_cm), the clamp absorbs the bonus, but the breakdown struct still reports the full unclamped bonus value. This makes the exposed debug metric incorrect — reporting a positive root bonus that had zero actual effect. The realized bonus should be capped to remaining depth or derived as effective - base."}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"7a3e4bd5-b7d8-4761-b0c6-66a31e299d24"}
